"Even if you were as useless as a scarecrow, or even more useless, since scarecrows at least scare away crows―"

pt:
//【小夏】
<voice name='小夏' class='小夏' src='voice/ma01/0150300b33'>
//「まるで何の役にも立たなくてカカシも同然
